        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c930e7d3-7607-4f3c-b19d-1f67cc7dddbf).Image",
        "Description": "Raymond is particular about his car&apos;s durability.\r\rMario is particular about his car&apos;s speed. \r\rFranklin is particular about his car&apos;s anatomy.\r\rThe three have come together to build the ultimate supercar in attempts of getting a chance to race their invention through the Colorado streets. However, they seem to be unable to salvage the parts they need with empty stomachs.\r\rA rival competitor, only known as The Fork, does not want anymore competition, and suggests a more... hearty approach.",
